{
 "version": 1,
 "note": "Single catalog of the viewer blocks and the actions voice can trigger. Read by the front (web/ui/commands.js) and by the API (api/commands.py). 'spoken' = star name, which Whisper transcribes well (a bare letter does not: bee/dee/ee/pee/tee sound the same); the agent's name is Marvin (api/voice.py: ACTIVATION). New action: add it here and register the handler in web/app.js.",
 "blocks": [
  {
